<title>HONG KONG: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on China Res.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on China Res.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co C.V. said on Wednesday it has launched 250 million American style call warrants on China Resources Enterprise Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrant control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$19.62	PREMIUM	    20.30 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.5224     GEARING	    3.95x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   29.APR.98     MIN EXER LOT     20,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$20.65	SETTLEMENT DATE  20.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG     LISTING DATE     21.MAY.97</p>
<p> NOTE		   PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
